  "summary_en": "AgID's draft guidelines (v1.0, Feb 2025, public consultation) for Italian public administrations adopting AI. They set principles, a PDCA-based adoption model aligned with ISO/IEC 42001, AI Act risk-tier compliance, data governance, data protection, cybersecurity, training, ethics governance and annexes. No robotics content.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "PAs must follow AI Act risk classification and obligations for high-risk systems",
   "Adoption model based on PDCA and ISO/IEC 42001 with AI strategy led by the digital transition officer (RTD)",
   "Twenty principles including accountability, transparency, human oversight, robustness and cybersecurity",
   "PAs must document use cases and periodically report them to AgID",
   "Annexes provide maturity assessment, risk and impact assessment, ethics code model and KPIs"
